Q: Getting the actual length of a UTF-8 encoded std::string? A: <p>Most (if not all) of the other answers only give the <em><strong>number of code points</strong></em> and <strong>completely fail</strong> for <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Combining_character" rel="nofollow noreferrer">combining characters</a>, emojis or <a href="https://stackoverflow.com/a/69414798/995714">more complex scripts</a>. For example here's an example output from <a href="https://stackoverflow.com/a/18850689/995714">user2781185's solution above</a> after modifying slightly for a <a href="https://godbolt.org/#z:OYLghAFBqd5TKALEBjA9gEwKYFFMCWALugE4A0BIEAZgQDbYB2AhgLbYgDkAjF%2BTXRMiAZVQtGIHgBYBQogFUAztgAKAD24AGfgCsp5eiyahUAUgBMAIUtXyKxqiIEh1ZpgDC6egFc2TEFl3ABkCJmwAOT8AI2xSKQB2cgAHdCViFyYvX39AlLSMoVDwqLZY%2BJ4kh2wnTJEiFlIibL8A2WraoXrGomLImLjE%2Bwamltz2kd6w/rLByoBKe3QfUlROLksAZjDUXxwAajNNj130cUYj3DMtAEEtnb3sQ%2BPUJSJMegJoy%2Bu7i22mLsfAcjh4XG9SNh2D9bvdAY9nh4IWFgDC/gCgSDji42MYCMk0b8AG7oAiYfbJUhhXrMYBEJAQDBMN77N6YEAgZEmQ4WABsEPmvzMCRst32%2BxYPhIrKIpGCzGeABEZaQAHSMEz0iCCzaim7itkcjBSxGgnkWeWapD7RlIRoAWiJEh82CU8xA5tNxxl7JAVOASCIXo8Po5KiIAHcIBZ5sGVZajnrfgbsER6GcJNgIMEPAB9G7BYLkc3MXMKESqqU0AAclhjieTrIIAC9sLmgz4lfstA2xRKpeh9gAqVC5iFdiGq0cQ7W9/VN1vt/aoO2kLw%2BYRdnu6xsRpAMLOds0Qy2CvvCvXi8VH6xHZVlDUQSy86eyswAVisPg/iuLJ4V9r7D4OqXleK6NOum62He%2Bw8HO4rCoqQp9oaaDLEGoJmnWxYanS1qMlgTypNSboenWcaof6gYUe8YaplGMZxuBa7LMIjZXhxV6Yd6daqvs9RUiYZEWBYNGkHGYAbO%2BHhMJJc6IchNzUvsuJhBAymNMAqDFsxw6aUSH42O%2BipnncIqNpS1KWnhT4ieINBmB4mxmDcACcdYgRZgk0latkWPZ2COR4ZjVnBImeX2lnCNZWp1mYuBwdW0ghT2CUhe%%2B9Q0izTgv8%2B5cN9S15Uo/Oy3VX58U9jcJWc4bLnQ8NZvG61jW4EbFti0bJtZU7rVXHb9NWD22ugXr6M1SJmBm1Y02pT2VgZS9QPHcAWUy0LT3OTczk%2B15Vn%2B35AAawfTbb4eR2LouC/DrWw9jJdWCnyNJgkSG3Fwiz0Nw778AEXA6OQ6DcMFt7WKyyyrE8Wx8OQRDaA3ixIFCODxNq5AANYgO%2BWiqjwmybNIG%2BuSJvK7xYshN1w0j8GwIC8gkqo79WrlaAk768psWgWO%2BFjkG3Hdd1w/BKCAWij%2BPiw4CwBQBgNgyQDwUCoARMBEC0BGBMBYHgPA/50HoEQOIP8IDRHHuQaIYRGgAE9uAjzwawUgBCADy0RdA1DHrwfgoCODCAoUwegRD278BwNEHwwAPASHoD/eh5A